[[:db/cas 17592186059981 :question/worked-solution nil "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\begin{vmatrix}\\sqrt{2} & 5 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{vmatrix}\n&=\\sqrt{2}\\cdot3-5\\cdot1 \\\\\n&=3\\sqrt{2}-5.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186056244 :answer-field/correct nil 17592186056247] [:db/ensure 17592186056244 :answer-field/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186056247 :answer/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186059981 :question/validate] [:db/cas 17592186060000 :question/worked-solution nil "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\begin{vmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 7\\end{vmatrix}\n&=2\\cdot7-(-4)\\cdot(-2) \\\\\n&=14-8 \\\\\n&=6.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186056358 :answer-field/correct nil 17592186056359] [:db/ensure 17592186056358 :answer-field/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186056359 :answer/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186060000 :question/validate] [:db/cas 17592186060001 :question/worked-solution nil "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\det(C)&=\\begin{vmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 5 & k\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&=2\\cdot k-3\\cdot5 \\\\\n&=2k-15.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\det(C)=3$, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n2k-15&=3 \\\\\n2k&=18 \\\\\nk&=9.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186056364 :answer-field/correct nil 17592186056365] [:db/ensure 17592186056364 :answer-field/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186056365 :answer/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186060001 :question/validate] [:db/cas 17592186060195 :question/worked-solution nil "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\det(A)&=\\begin{vmatrix}1+t & 2t \\\\ -3 & 1-t\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&=(1+t)(1-t)-(2t)(-3) \\\\\n&=1-t^2+6t.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\det(A)=10$, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n1-t^2+6t&=10 \\\\\nt^2-6t+9&=0 \\\\\n(t-3)^2&=0 \\\\\nt&=3.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186057630 :answer-field/correct nil 17592186057633] [:db/ensure 17592186057630 :answer-field/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186057633 :answer/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186060195 :question/validate] {:db/id "answer" :answer/id #uuid "2d273204-9c71-5dd0-b69b-1a90276ae151" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4"} {:db/id "field" :answer-field/id #uuid "d37edfe3-8d04-5659-9550-117d4c4acd83" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["answer"] :answer-field/correct "answer"} [:db/cas 17592186233379 :question/problem "If\n$$\n\\displaystyle D=\\begin{bmatrix}2x & 6 \\\\ 2x & x-2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand $det(D)=-32$, what is the value of $x?$" "If\n$$\n\\displaystyle D=\\begin{bmatrix}2x & 6 \\\\ 2x & x-2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand $det(D)=-32$, what is the value of $x?$\n\n$x=$ {{field-1}}"] [:db/add 17592186233379 :question/answer-fields "field"] [:db/ensure "answer" :answer/validate] [:db/ensure "field" :answer-field/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186233379 :question/validate]]
